1m0|n|Next; later in time; subsequent; succeeding; as, an after period of life. ; Hinder; nearer the rear. ; To ward the stern of the ship; -- applied to any object in the rear part of a vessel; as the after cabin, after hatchway.	N:1qua,1,1~1qua,1,1
